Propagate repeated-field allocation failure from message cloning.

upb_Array_DeepClone can return NULL. Returning true in that case hides the
failure and lets the caller return a clone whose repeated field is missing.
The installed C contract has a bounded --array-oom allocator-failure case.

Origin: EmberBSD local adaptation. Prepared with AI assistance.
Upstream status: not submitted.

--- upb/message/copy.c.orig
+++ upb/message/copy.c
@@ -169,6 +169,7 @@
 
   // Clear out upb_Array* due to parent memcpy.
   upb_Message_SetBaseField(clone, field, &cloned_array);
+  if (cloned_array == NULL) return false;
   return true;
 }
 
